<title>UK: Douglas Hall ups stake in Newscastle United.</title>
<headline>Douglas Hall ups stake in Newscastle United.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Douglas Hall, non-executive director of Newcastle United Plc, purchased 180,000 ordinary shares and increased his stake to 57.8 percent, the company said on Monday</p>
<p>Hall bought the five-pence shares at 138.5 pence each on Monday and he now owns 82.80 million shares in Newscastle.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
